\newlabel{fig:safecard}{{16}{7}{Safety scorecard for the 15-queue frozen synthetic holdout. All four metrics are identical across both arms. Grouped-pair precision is 100\% when no false pairs exist; zero observed errors under simulator truth is not an operational error-rate bound}{figure.caption.21}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {17}{\ignorespaces Per-queue change on the paired synthetic holdout. Each cell is the endpoint-fallback count minus the frozen-baseline count for the indicated metric, computed from the archived queue result CSV. Blue-green marks gains, brown marks losses, and white denotes no change; the printed integers make the graphic readable without color. Queue numbering is anonymized display order, not a time series.}}{7}{figure.caption.22}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:queueheat}{{17}{7}{Per-queue change on the paired synthetic holdout. Each cell is the endpoint-fallback count minus the frozen-baseline count for the indicated metric, computed from the archived queue result CSV. Blue-green marks gains, brown marks losses, and white denotes no change; the printed integers make the graphic readable without color. Queue numbering is anonymized display order, not a time series}{figure.caption.22}{}}
